<title>POLAND: Polish Impexmetal to start bourse trade June 24.</title>
<headline>Polish Impexmetal to start bourse trade June 24.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish metals trader Impexmetal SA will start trade on the main market of the Warsaw bourse on June 24, the bourse said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bourse said 6,325,190 series A shares would enter the exchange along with 3,189,171 series B shares offered in the firm's April public offering at 36 zlotys.</p>
<p>In May the state sold 2,994,142 of its series A shares at 36 zlotys. The offer was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
